  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/981858?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=#F16436&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-recipe\" alt=\"CurseForge\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/7AXsRqp1?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=#00AF5C&link=https://modrinth.com/datapack/extra-recipe\" alt=\"Modrinth 下载\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/CTNStudio/Extra-Recipe?display_timestamp=committer&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=#181717&link=https://github.com/CTNStudio/Extra-Recipe\" alt=\"GitHub 最新提交\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1152184082130813009?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&color=#5865F2&cacheSeconds=https://discord.gg/2Eb53FxvYf&link=https://discord.gg/ZUzg99PDsw\" alt=\"Discord 服务器\"></p>\n<p>还在为找不到附魔金苹果而苦恼吗？还在对铁砧磨损束手无策吗？</p>\n<p>额外配方来解决你的烦恼！该项目具体提供或添加的内容：钻石/金/铁马铠合成表、命名牌合成表、不死图腾合成表、附魔金苹果合成表（以及更多！）……</p>\n<p>为什么你应该下载这个项目：因为它非常棒。 :)</p>\n<p>下载前需要了解的其他重要信息：你可以随时向我提出任何相关问题。</p>\n<p>玩法有趣！</p>\n<h2>版本兼容性</h2>\n<p>关于文件后缀：后缀代表支持的版本。具体支持的版本见下表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本后缀</th>\n<th>Minecraft 版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>1.13 – 1.14.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-5</td>\n<td>1.15 – 1.16.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-6</td>\n<td>1.16.2 – 1.16.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-7</td>\n<td>1.17 – 1.17.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-8</td>\n<td>1.18 – 1.18.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-9</td>\n<td>1.18.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-10</td>\n<td>1.19 – 1.19.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-12</td>\n<td>1.19.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-15</td>\n<td>1.20 – 1.20.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-18</td>\n<td>1.20.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-26</td>\n<td>1.20.3 – 1.20.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-41</td>\n<td>1.20.5 – 1.20.6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-48</td>\n<td>1.21 – 1.21.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-57</td>\n<td>1.21.2 – 1.21.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-61</td>\n<td>1.21.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-71</td>\n<td>1.21.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-80</td>\n<td>1.21.6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td